WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.860
Would you say it has not been fantastic?

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:05.090
It has not been marvelous.

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.430
Or fantastic.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:11.500
Or amazing, or spiderman.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.959
I'm here with Tom and Nina to talk about which
actors and actresses we most want to join

00:00:15.959 --> 00:00:17.110
the MCU.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:22.380
Nina, which actors and actresses do you most
want to join the MCU?

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.970
Well, one of these was just gifted to me a
couple of days ago because you know, Julia

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:31.810
Louis Dreyfus just recently joined the MCU,
and as many people know she was the star of

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:36.530
many TV shows, but most recently and notably
she starred on Veep.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:41.231
And one of her co-stars, Sam Richardson, said
that he wants to play Beast in the MCU because

00:00:41.231 --> 00:00:45.920
he thinks that Beast is his Veep character,
Richard Split, but huge and with blue hair.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.070
Oh, that rocks.

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.520
And I love Sam Richardson.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.520
He's great on Veep.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.570
If you're not familiar with him, you're really
missing out on him.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:57.180
He's also...he works with Tim Robinson a lot
and was on my favorite show of my life, I

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:58.180
Think You Should Leave.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.080
And they work together on Detroiters.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.050
I would love to see Sam Richardson join the
MCU.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:04.860
And that got me thinking of like other comedians.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:08.920
I think Ben Schwartz would be really funny
in the MCU, but I don't know where he would

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:09.920
go.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.270
Like improvisers, like Lauren Lapkus would
be really funny as well.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:13.270
Yeah.

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:17.810
I was just thinking about like, the MCU is
known for being funny, right?

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:22.260
I mean, James Gunn and take away Taika Waititi
especially like have very distinct senses

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.830
of humor, and that really shines through in
their movies.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:28.560
And then I was also like, wouldn't it be weird
if like Timothee Chalamet just popped up at

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:33.590
the MCU as like a really like emo teen alien.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.020
I wouldn't say no to...

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:36.020
Who could he be?

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.049
Who could Timothee Chalamet play?

00:01:37.049 --> 00:01:40.510
I was thinking about like, you know, Florence
Pugh just joined, and she was in Little Women

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:45.030
with Timothee Chalamet and Saoirse Ronan,
and I'm like, hmm, Laura Dern?

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:46.910
Let's throw her in the mix too.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:49.009
I don't think Timothee Chalamet could play
Laura Dern.

00:01:49.009 --> 00:01:50.770
I don't think he has the range for it.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:51.850
Well I mean, that's fair.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.650
No one can play Laura Dern except for Laura
Dern.

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:55.909
That's right.

00:01:55.909 --> 00:01:59.750
But yeah I mean, I know I was just all over
the map with that, but you know, obviously

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.360
more comedians is never going to hurt.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:03.049
Sam Richardson definitely should play Beast.

00:02:03.049 --> 00:02:05.590
I hope he already got the offer to be honest
with you.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:06.590
But yeah.

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:11.319
I mean, let's let some of these prestige actors
like Laura Dern or Timothee Chalamet have

00:02:11.319 --> 00:02:12.340
a little fun.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.340
Okay.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.340
I like it.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:18.290
I've never heard anybody say that more comedians
couldn't hurt before.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.510
But maybe that's just the air in the wind.

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:24.959
I think you've just been doing standup for
too long Tom.

00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:27.790
I haven't been doing standup for not long
enough.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.790
So...

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.180
Tom, what are some of the actors and actresses
you want to see added to the MCU?

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.570
First off it seems like a crime that Rowan
Atkinson hasn't been a part of this yet.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:37.570
Oh, good one.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:38.570
Rowan Atkinson.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:39.709
Thank you very much.

00:02:39.709 --> 00:02:43.561
I mean, number one, I don't think that we've
seen enough straight white men in the MCU,

00:02:43.561 --> 00:02:47.069
and I that he could really fill a vacuum there.

00:02:47.069 --> 00:02:48.069
Right.

00:02:48.069 --> 00:02:51.510
Also just the...no, that those seem weird,
right?

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:54.510
Like that seems like an easy paycheck that
he could've picked up.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:55.510
For Rowan Atkinson?

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:57.810
Yeah, he doesn't have to be a main character.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.790
It's just like, he's a background Nova Corps,
like standing up too straight and not approving

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.430
of these Guardians of the Galaxy.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:05.430
Something like that.

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:11.190
He could do something kind of like...I mean,
I never enjoy bringing up Love Actually personally,

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:15.420
but in that movie, he just kind of floats
around on the fringe and like interacts with

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.019
different characters and it's the best part
of the movie.

00:03:18.019 --> 00:03:19.019
Totally.

00:03:19.019 --> 00:03:20.019
You know, yeah.

00:03:20.019 --> 00:03:22.050
He could do something like that in the MCU
and I would be on board.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:23.720
I'm down for it.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.720
Yeah.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:29.920
He could just come back as the same character
he played in The Tall Guy.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:38.750
So yeah, that'd be...right now, I'm just bonkers
for HBO adaptation of Doom Patrol that they're

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.750
doing.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:44.740
If they wanted to bring the entire cast of
that show into play, like, their analog X-men

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.319
characters, I think...

00:03:46.319 --> 00:03:48.680
That's an interesting thought.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:49.680
I like that.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.680
I'd watch it.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.680
Yeah.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:52.680
Yeah, no problem.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:53.680
Yeah.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:54.950
So Brendan Fraser would be who?

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.870
Who's the analog to Robotman?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.520
It's got to be Wolverine, right?

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:01.250
You bring him in as like the angry break stuff
guy.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.250
Oh, yeah.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.250
Is he Canadian?

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.250
I think he's Canadian, is he?

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:05.250
He is Canadian.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.250
So it wouldn't even be appropriation, and
he's...yeah.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.420
No, he's got his memory all dicked with, so
yeah.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.420
No that's Wolverine.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:10.420
So that works.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.420
Yeah.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:12.420
That'd be cool.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:18.144
I mean, I'm never against watching Timothee...

00:04:18.144 --> 00:04:19.144
Chalamet.

00:04:19.144 --> 00:04:20.144
I'm for it.

00:04:20.144 --> 00:04:22.571
Yeah, Timothee Chalamet.

00:04:22.571 --> 00:04:24.528
Justice for Timothee Chalamet.

00:04:24.528 --> 00:04:25.924
Sorry, what were you going to say?

00:04:25.924 --> 00:04:27.508
He'll be part of Doom Patrol.

00:04:27.508 --> 00:04:31.059
No, I've been watching the version of Doom
Patrol where Timothee Chalamet just live-streams

00:04:31.059 --> 00:04:34.270
himself watching it too, like, eating handfuls
of Oreos.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:37.589
I mean, now that we're on the subject of Doom
Patrol, Alan Tudyk, right?

00:04:37.589 --> 00:04:39.659
Is that how you say his name?

00:04:39.659 --> 00:04:40.659
Alan Tudyk.

00:04:40.659 --> 00:04:41.669
How has he not been in the MCU yet?

00:04:41.669 --> 00:04:44.409
I think he does a lot of work for Disney too.

00:04:44.409 --> 00:04:45.409
And he's good.

00:04:45.409 --> 00:04:48.449
And isn't he actually starring on a TV show
right now where he plays an alien in human

00:04:48.449 --> 00:04:49.449
form?

00:04:49.449 --> 00:04:53.712
He's starring in 80 TV shows and he's in like
