00:05:00.229 --> 00:05:01.229
This is wonky.

00:05:01.229 --> 00:05:04.610
Do you think we could get him and Gina Torres
in there together somehow?

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.210
I feel relatively positive...

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:08.240
