00:05:12.029 --> 00:05:13.830
We've already got Nathan Fillion, he's got
two different parts...

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.669
I was going to say, Nathan Fillion just popped
up in.

00:05:16.669 --> 00:05:18.430
But that's Suicide Squad, right?

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:22.889
Nathan Fillion was going to be Wonder Man
