But he has like cameos in the Guardians movies,
cause I think he's friends with James Gunn.

00:05:28.719 --> 00:05:30.379
He is friends with James Gunn.

00:05:30.379 --> 00:05:32.039
Was he in the Guardian's movies?

00:05:32.039 --> 00:05:34.150
